      en: ["The garden is part of the Faculty of Agronomic Sciences at the University of Abomey-Calavi.", "It houses over 200 documented species of medicinal plants from the region.", "The attached herbarium contains thousands of dried plant specimens.", "Guided excursions are regularly organized for university and school students.", "The garden serves as a pilot site for reforestation projects in Southern Benin.", "Research findings from this garden are published in international botanical journals."],
